# jaaOS — prometheus daemon options (Phase 5).
# Bind to localhost only; retention kept short by default (lite mode). `jaa-health enable`
# rewrites the retention to match the selected mode (lite=7d, full=30d).
# Shorter retention also means less historical activity-timing data persists on disk — a small
# mitigation, NOT a deniability guarantee (see docs/06-phase5-monitoring.md §Deniability).
ARGS="--config.file=/etc/prometheus/prometheus.yml \
--storage.tsdb.path=/var/lib/prometheus/metrics2 \
--storage.tsdb.retention.time=7d \
--web.listen-address=127.0.0.1:9090 \
--web.enable-lifecycle"
